-- Plan-guided lazy enumeration (design plan-guided-lazy-enumeration, M1):
-- inline predicate body over a neural ADT output WITHOUT an `of` clause. On
-- the plan-backed lazy path, probability inference reads softmax slices of the
-- raw logit vector instead of enumerating the support.
-- planEnumInlineMaterialized.ppl is the same program with an `of` clause and
-- identical expected values.
-- Since task of-annotation-and-auto-derived-enumeration-divergence every read
-- is tagged with its resolved annotation, so this program (under the dense
-- budget) enumerates densely by default, exactly as its `of` spelling does.
-- The plan engine is checked on it at budget 0 by End2End's
-- PlanEngineMatchesDense.
data Color = Red | Green | Blue
neural readColor :: (Symbol -> (Color, Color))
main sym = draw s = readColor sym in if isRed (fst s) then (if isRed (snd s) then 2 else 1) else (if isRed (snd s) then 1 else 0)
